# Data Cleaning & Reporting Automation 🧹

A one-command pipeline that cleans a messy raw dataset (missing values, duplicates, inconsistent formatting, invalid entries) and automatically generates a visual HTML summary report — no manual spreadsheet work.

## Features
- Removes exact duplicate records
- Standardizes inconsistent text formatting (e.g. `delhi` / `DELHI` / `Delhi` → `Delhi`)
- Detects and fixes invalid values (negative/out-of-range ages, negative purchase amounts)
- Imputes missing numeric values with median; fills missing categorical values with `Unknown`
- Parses and standardizes date fields
- Logs every cleaning action taken (`cleaning_log.txt`) for full traceability
- Auto-generates a styled HTML report with KPIs, a cleaning log, a top-cities table, and 4 summary charts

## Tech Stack
Python · Pandas · NumPy · Matplotlib

